  {
   "text": "Every bank and corporate-finance team on your summer-analyst list is recruiting here in one afternoon, and your Smith Investment Fund analyst reps give you real work to lead with. This is where recruiters start building their first-round lists, before applications formally open. Come in with the five firms you most want and a tight version of your fund pitch ready.",
   "x": 198,
   "y": 385,
   "w": 613,
   "h": 85
  },
  {
   "text": "About this event",
   "x": 198,
   "y": 510,
   "w": 104,
   "h": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "Smith's flagship fall fair brings 80+ employers to the Grand Ballroom for one afternoon: bulge-bracket banks, the Big 4, and Fortune 500 corporate finance teams, all recruiting finance, accounting, and information systems talent. Recruiters run open conversations, collect resumes on the spot, and many use the day to start building their first-round interview lists for summer 2027. Come with printed resumes and a short list of the firms you most want to reach.",
